./ R 00295000          $ 00295010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,ALLONES -- RE-ENABLE CHANNEL 0. THERE IS NO  XA0016DK         
*  CHANNEL MASK ON ESA/390; CR6 CARRIES THE I/O SUBCLASS MASK  XA0016DK         
*  AND IS ALREADY ALL EIGHT SUBCLASSES. I-73.                  XA0016DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE. I-73.          XA0016DK         
./ R 00412000          $ 00412100 100                                           
*  WAS ISK -- THE KEYS OF REAL PAGES 0-3, READ 2 KB AT A TIME  XA0016DK         
*  INTO SAVKEY(8). UNDER 4 KB KEYS EACH PAIR NOW REPEATS,      XA0016DK         
*  WHICH IS WHAT THE HARDWARE MEANS. I-109.                    XA0016DK         
NXTKEY   ISKE  R9,R3          GET KEYS OF INITIAL 4 PAGES      XA0016DK         
./ R 00500000          $ 00500100 100                                           
         ISKE  R0,R3          GET STORAGE KEY -- I-109         XA0016DK         
./ R 00505000          $ 00505100 100                                           
         ISKE  R0,R3          GET STORAGE KEY -- I-109         XA0016DK         
./ R 00710300          $ 00710400 100                                           
         XASIO R15            START IO                         XA0016DK         
./ R 00722000          $ 00722100 100                                           
*  THE INTERRUPTING DEVICE ADDRESS IS IN THE INTERRUPTION      XA0016DK         
*  PARAMETER NOW, PUT THERE BY DMKCPI'S MSCH. I-47.            XA0016DK         
         CH    R15,IOINTPRM+2 INTERRUPT FOR DUMP DISK ?        XA0016DK         
./ R 00731000 00735000 $ 00731100 100                                           
*  R-26: BOTH *-4 BRANCHES SPANNED A TIO AND NOW NAME IT.      XA0016DK         
DMPCL1   XATIO R15            TEST IO                          XA0016DK         
         BC    6,DMPCL1       CLEAR DEVICE                     XA0016DK         
         XASIO R15            START IO (SENSE)                 XA0016DK         
DMPWT1   XATIO R15            WAIT FOR IT                      XA0016DK         
         BC    6,DMPWT1       BRANCH IF BUSY OR STATUS         XA0016DK         
./ R 00738030 00738080 $ 00738031 001                                           
DMPCL2   XATIO R15            DRAIN ANY INTERRUPTS             XA0016DK         
         BC    7,DMPCL2       LOOP UNTIL READY                 XA0016DK         
DMPST2   XASIO R15            READ R0 FOR ALT TRACK ADDR       XA0016DK         
         BC    7,DMPST2       LOOP UNTIL STARTED               XA0016DK         
DMPWT2   XATIO R15            TEST FOR COMPLETION              XA0016DK         
         BC    7,DMPWT2       TRY AGAIN                        XA0016DK         
./ R 00769000          $ 00769100 100                                           
SIOIPL   XASIO R15            RE-READ THE IPL RECORD           XA0016DK         
./ R 00775000          $ 00775100 100                                           
TIOIPL   XATIO R15            TEST                             XA0016DK         
./ R 00776000          $ 00776100 100                                           
         BNZ   TIOIPL         WAIT                             XA0016DK         
./ R 00777000          $ 00777100 100                                           
*  SYSIPLDV IS CP'S OWN FIELD FOR THE IPL DEVICE ADDRESS, SET  XA0016DK         
*  BY DMKCPI AND READ IN SIX PLACES. X'BA' NEVER MEANT IT.     XA0016DK         
*  I-47.                                                       XA0016DK         
         STH   R15,SYSIPLDV   SAVE IPL DEVICE ADDRESS          XA0016DK         
./ R 00779000 00782000 $ 00779100 100                                           
DMPST3   XASIO R15            START                            XA0016DK         
         BNZ   DMPST3         WAIT                             XA0016DK         
DMPWT3   XATIO R15            TEST                             XA0016DK         
         BNZ   DMPWT3         WAIT                             XA0016DK         
./ R 00804000 00807000 $ 00804100 100                                           
DMPST4   XASIO R15            START                            XA0016DK         
         BNZ   DMPST4         WAIT                             XA0016DK         
DMPWT4   XATIO R15            TEST                             XA0016DK         
         BNZ   DMPWT4         WAIT                             XA0016DK         
./ R 00976000 00977000 $ 00976100 100                                           
DRAINEND XATIO R15            DRAIN LAST INTERRUPT             XA0016DK         
         BNZ   DRAINEND       WAIT                             XA0016DK         
./ R 01005000 01006000 $ 01005100 100                                           
DMPCL5   XATIO R1             CLEAR PENDING INTS               XA0016DK         
         BC    2,DMPCL5       STILL BUSY, KEEP TRYING          XA0016DK         
./ R 01012000 01013000 $ 01012100 100                                           
DOMONSIO XASIO R1             START THE DEVICE                 XA0016DK         
         BC    2,DOMONSIO     BUSY, KEEP TRYING                XA0016DK         
./ R 01016000 01017000 $ 01016100 100                                           
DOTIO    XATIO R1             CLEAR THE STATUS                 XA0016DK         
         BC    2,DOTIO        BUSY, KEEP TRYING                XA0016DK         
./ R 01054000          $ 01054100 100                                           
         ISKE  R3,R4          GET STORAGE KEY -- I-109         XA0016DK         
./ R 01129000          $ 01129100 100                                           
         XATIO R15            IS THE PATH FREE ?               XA0016DK         
./ R 01144000 01145000 $ 01144100 100                                           
DMPCL6   XATIO R15            DRAIN INTERRUPT                  XA0016DK         
         BC    2,DMPCL6       LOOP ON BUSY                     XA0016DK         
./ R 01151000          $ 01151100 100                                           
WAITRET  CH    R15,IOINTPRM+2 INTERRUPT FROM RIGHT DEVICE ?    XA0016DK         
./ R 01157000 01158000 $ 01157100 100                                           
DMPWT7   XATIO R15            TEST                             XA0016DK         
         BC    2,DMPWT7       CC=2; CHANNEL STILL BUSY         XA0016DK         
./ R 01161000          $ 01161100 100                                           
PRSIO    XASIO R15            START                            XA0016DK         
./ R 01169000 01170000 $ 01169100 100                                           
GOTIO    XATIO R15            ISSUE TIO TO 'DUMP' DEVICE       XA0016DK         
         BC    2,GOTIO        CC=2, CHANNEL STILL BUSY         XA0016DK         
./ I 01556000 $ 01556100 100                                                    
*  AFTER THE CLOSING ORG. DMKDMP'S ONLY CLEARS ARE XC          XA0016DK         
*  SENSDATA(24) AND AN MVCL OVER REAL PAGES 1 TO 3, SO         XA0016DK         
*  NOTHING ZEROES THIS. I-55.                                  XA0016DK         
         XAIOWORK             XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP       XA0016DK         
         COPY  XABLOKS        FOR ORBCCWFM, THE CCW FORMAT     XA0016DK         
